ylia.\nWith this character design, she is the embodiment of the \"Butterfly effect\". \nShe is similar to an eldritch deity.\n\nHer personality gives off, something complex and unpredictable although her gaze soft and calculating. She is sometimes surrounded by pinkish red butterflies.\n\nOne of her pupils is white and the other is black! they are diamond shaped.\nShe has feline/foxlike droopy ears but no tail that is visible. \nFeel free to use any pose!\nThank you~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Lujjrj2nRllF-gDftivdAVmIs5_Cqg1X?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@enzerutarutopaf/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3968294, "client_id": 2028846, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0db76065/uploads/origins/6b73649f-2c46-4c29-ad2a-5489cb647367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5e4bac0406bf201d3dd6beb024c9ffc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0db76065/uploads/origins/6b73649f-2c46-4c29-ad2a-5489cb647367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5e4bac0406bf201d3dd6beb024c9ffc, https://si.imgix.net/0db76065/uploads/origins/6b73649f-2c46-4c29-ad2a-5489cb647367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76c4ef5d07b2967a523578b3b54c51a5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0db76065/uploads/origins/6b73649f-2c46-4c29-ad2a-5489cb647367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1d975c1002813e36b0e4cbbae32a56d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0db76065/uploads/origins/6b73649f-2c46-4c29-ad2a-5489cb647367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=186664ced3cdfefd37edfc453eb05533", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0db76065